                "textId": "Performance_203106702_305969317_fakeName",
                "value": null
              },
              "content": "嗯。你还记得咩？\n我在海岸边寻找海贝玩偶的灵感。\n忽然遇到了下雨的那天。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_203106702_305969317_content",
                "value": "嗯。你还记得咩？\n我在海岸边寻找海贝玩偶的灵感。\n忽然遇到了下雨的那天。"
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 305969317
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "绵朵莉",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_203106702_305969318_fakeName",
                "value": null
              },
              "content": "那次，我被雨水打湿，\n为了避免淋到更多，\n我一动也咩敢动。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_203106702_305969318_content",
                "value": "那次，我被雨水打湿，\n为了避免淋到更多，\n我一动也咩敢动。"
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 305969318
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "绵朵莉",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_203106702_305969319_fakeName",
                "value": null
              },
              "content": "那天，你正在海岸边，\n帮我抓到了需要的海贝。\n还把我送回了家……",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_203106702_305969319_content",
                "value": "那天，你正在海岸边，\n帮我抓到了需要的海贝。\n还把我送回了家……"
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 305969319
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "绵朵莉",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_203106702_305969320_fakeName",
                "value": null
              },
              "content": "想不到，\n那个海贝，\n居然是万象馆从未收藏过的特殊物种。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_203106702_305969320_content",
                "value": "想不到，\n那个海贝，\n居然是万象馆从未收藏过的特殊物种。"
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 305969320
            },
            {
